	)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE: VC FILTER  (R_VC / C_VC)\n(TI Datasheet 8.2.1.2.1, p.192)\n1. R_VC = 100 ohm, C_VC = 0.47 uF. TI fixed values, do not change.\n2. Differential RC: cap across adjacent VC lines.\n   fc ~ 1/(2*pi*200*0.47u) = 1.7 kHz.\n3. Values also give hot-plug protection when harness is connected live.\n4. 100 ohm keeps input-current error < 1 mV.\n5. Cap sees 1 cell max (4.2 V). TI min 16 V; use 25 V X7R (DC-bias margin)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 45.72 0)
		(size 66.04 22.86)
		(margins 2 2 2 2)
		(stroke
			(width 1)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "84bd0f9e-60be-40be-bb2c-afb1da8b75dc")
	)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE: CB FILTER CAPS + BAT FILTER\n(TI Datasheet 8.2.1.2.1-8.2.1.2.2, pp.192-193)\n1. C_CB = 0.47 uF (TI fixed): hot-plug + filtering, fc ~ 17 kHz.\n2. Clean CB path needed for VC-vs-CB (AUX ADC) diagnostic comparison.\n3. BAT: R1 = 30 ohm, C1 = 10 nF (TI fixed, hot-plug)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 154.94 0)
		(size 66.04 15.24)
		(margins 2 2 2 2)
		(stroke
			(width 1)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9b5d0e8b-1abe-4ef6-9969-638b34990b4d")
	)
	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE: CELL SENSE (SLUSE81F)\n1. VC/CB filter caps at U1 pins; RC values per 8.2.1.2.1 (p.192).\n2. VC and CB traces run in parallel, impedance matched (within 10mm based off TI example layout no other spec listed); CB traces sized for\n   ~190 mA balancing (10.1.3, p.205).\n3. Unused VC9-16/CB9-16 tie to BAT pin with minimum trace; never to a wire\n   or cable (Fig. 8-2a, p.192).\n5. Balancing heat: ~3 W/board at 4 channels; spread R_CB (2512)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 48.26 76.314 0)
		(size 76.2 22.746)
		(margins 2.25 2.25 2.25 2.25)
		(stroke
			(width 1)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 255 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 255 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9e8965b4-6b7b-4c54-8cf5-edfc58f91b50")
	)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE: CB BALANCE RESISTORS  (R_CB = 10 ohm, 2512 / 1 W)\n(TI Datasheet 7.3.3 p.36; Rdson 6.5 p.13; 240 mA limit p.1)\n1. I_CB = Vcell / (2*R_CB + Rdson). Current flows through BOTH R_CB\n   (CBn and CBn-1) and the internal balance FET.\n2. Rdson = 1.45-4.6 ohm (rises with die temp, part-to-part; spec Vcell > 2.8 V).\n   Vcell    I_CB (Rdson 1.45 / 4.6)   P per R_CB    P per cell\n   3.0 V    140 / 122 mA              0.15-0.20 W   ~0.4 W\n   3.6 V    168 / 146 mA              0.21-0.28 W   ~0.6 W\n   4.2 V    196 / 171 mA              0.29-0.38 W   ~0.8 W\n3. Max 196 mA < 240 mA limit (240 mA rated at 75 C ambient).\n4. ~1 % SOC/hr on 20 Ah Enepaq block.\n5. Less heat option: R_CB = 20 ohm -> ~100 mA, ~1/4 power."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 73.66 0)
		(size 66.04 30.48)
		(margins 2 2 2 2)
		(stroke
			(width 1)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bd909a28-8ba9-447b-8d3e-febbbf54b9d5")
	)
